# m5max-40c-swift15-draft.choices: only the DFlash draft's affine projections at 1-4 lanes (from
# m5max-40c-swift15-v12.choices). For GGUF models with no choices file of their own (Q2/Q3_K, IQ
# quants, ...): every GGUF assembly runs Inco's affine DFlash2 draft, and affine lines key affine
# workloads only, so the GGUF target keeps Splash's defaults.
